<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 Timothi</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timothi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Paul, Khrist Jesu a hinna om chiamna thugenna dungzui a, Pathian deihdana Khrist Jesu sawltak in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka tapa deihtak Timothi kiang ah: Pathian leh Khrist Jesu a i Toupa kiang a kipan hehpihna, zahngaihna, lemna om hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sun leh zan khawllou a ka thumnate a nang hon theigige in, ka pi ka pu a kipan a sialehpha theihna siangtak nei a a na ka sep gige pa, Pathian kiang ah kipah thu ka hilh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kipak a ka dim theihna ding in honmuh ka ut mahmah hi, na khitui theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ginna taktak nangmah a om ka theigige a, huai ginna a tung in napi Loisi ah a om a, na nu Iunisi ah leng a om a, huan nangmah ah leng a om chih diktak in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huaiziak in ka khut ngak ziak a Pathian thilthawnpiak nangmah a om pen mutkuang ding in k’on theisak ahi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian in launa kha a honpe kei a, thilhihtheihna leh itna leh kithuzohna tak neihna a honpe zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Huchi in i Toupa thu theihsak zumpih kenla, kei a hentapa leng hon zumpih sam ken. Tanchinhoih ziak a gimthuak Pathian thilhihtheihna dungzuiin hon thuakpih zaw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aman i thilhihte bang hilou in, amah seh leh a ma hehpihna bang zaw in hon hondama, sapna siangthou in a honsam hi; huai hehpihna leilung pianma a Khrist Jesu a honpiak ahita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh i Hondampa Khrist Jesu kilakna ziak in tuin hihlat in a omta hi. Aman sihna hihmang in, Tanchinhoih in hinna leh manthat theihlouhna a hihlangta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Huai Tanchinhoih theisak ding a tangkoupihpa, sawltak leh sinsaktu a seh ka hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hiai ziak in ahi hiai thilte leng ka na thuak. Himahleh ka zum kei; ka ginpa ka thei a, a kiang a ka kepsak huaini ading in a kemhoih thei chih diktak in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Khrist Jesu a om ginna leh itna nei in, thudikte ka kam a nazakte zui tinten in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I sung a om Kha Siangthou hon kepsak thutak kem hoih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asia gam a om tengteng te’n a hon nungngatsan uh chih na thei a; a lak ua Phigella leh Harmojini a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Toupa’n Onesifora inkuanpihte kiang ah zahngaihna pia hen aw, aman a hon hihhalh zelzel hi. Ka khainiang but leng a hon zumpih kei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rome khua a a omlai in hon limzon a, a hon mukhia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai ni chiang in Toupa kiang a zahngaihna mu ding in Toupa’n amah sep hen. Ephesa khua a a nasep thupidan na thei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huchi in nang ka tapa, Khrist Jesu a hehpihna om ah thilhihtheihna nei in om in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theihpih tampite lak a ka kam a thu nazakte, mi muanhuai, midangte hilhsawn theidingte kiang ah kemsak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khrist Jesu sepaih hoih bang in gimthuak hon thuakpih in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sepaih a om ding a a telpa kipahsak theihna ding in, sepaih kuamah kidou lai in hiai damsung khosaknate in a ki subuai ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Huan kidemnate ah mite pang mahleh dan bang a ahihkeileh khuksak in a om ngeikei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Louneipa semgim a gah tang masapa ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thugentak ngaihtuah in; Toupa’n thil tengteng ah theihsiamna a honpe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesu Khrist, David suan, ka Tanchinhoih gen bang a misi lak a kipan a thounawnpa theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Huai Tanchinhoih ziak in thil hihkhialpa bang in hen hial in gimna ka thuakzel hi; himahleh Pathian thu hen in a omkei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Huaiziak in Khrist Jesu a hotdamna tangtawn a thupina toh a muhsam theihna ding un, telte ziak in bangkim ka thuak gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hiai thugen a dik hi: “A sihna a i sih khit ngal leh, a hinna ah i hing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I thuak leh a vaihawmna ah vai i hawm sam ding hi; Amah i kitheihmohbawl leh Aman leng hon kitheihmohbawl ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eite muanhuailou in om mah lehang, Amah zaw muanhuai in a om gige hi; Amah leh amah a kitheihmohbawl thei ngalkei hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hiai theisak inla, thute leltak tung a a kisel louhna ding un Toupa muh in phatuamngaitak in theisak in; huai kiselna bangmah a phatuam kei a, a ngaikhete ading in siatna ahizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nasemtu, zumna ding neilou, thutak thu diktak a zang, Pathian pomtak hi ding a nangmah kipe ding in theihtawpsuah in kisin in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian zahlouh thugen mawkmawkte nungngatsan in; huchibang mite Pathian limsaklouhna lam ah a pai gamla semsem ding ua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a thu un meima sia nek bang in a nezel ding; a lak uah Himenaia leh Phileta a pang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Huai mite’n thohnawnna a omkhinta chi in, thutak lam a pialsan ua, mikhenkhatte ginna a hih mangsak uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Himahleh Pathian suangphum kip a dinglai a, hiai chiamtehna a nei hi: “Toupa’n amah a te a thei” chih leh “Toupa min lou peuhmah in diktatlouhna paisan hen,” chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Himahleh inn thupi ah tuium-belsuan dangkaeng leh dangka a bawlte kia a omkei a, sing leh bellei a bawlte leng a om hi; khenkhatte manphataka zat a om a, khenkhatte manphalou deuh a zat leng a omsam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huaiziak in mi huai thilgiloute lak a a kihep leh, tuium-belsuan manphataka zat ding, siangthou, Toupa inn a zattak, nasep hoih chiteng dia mansa, ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Himahleh valnou duhgawlnate taisan inla, lungtang siangthou a Toupa lou peuhmahte lak a diktatna, ginna, itna, leh lametna delh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Himahleh kidounate a suaksak nak chih thei in, kiselna haihuai leh pillou ah pang nuam ken.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Toupa sikha in a dou ding a hi kei a, mi tengteng tung a siamtum in, thuhilh siam in, gitlouh tung a thuakzou in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amah doute thunuailut tak in a thuhilh zaw ding hi. Huchi in Pathian in thutak a theihna ding un a kisiksak zenzen kha ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Huchi in khua a hon theithei ding ua, amaute suak leh sal a man a a utut a bawlpa Diabol thang a kipan a suakta thei ding uh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Huan hiai thei in, ni nanung ah hun haksa pipi a hongom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi amau ki-itte, dangka deihtate, kiuangsakte, kisatheite, Pathian gensete, nu leh pa thu mangloute, kipahna dan theiloute, siangthouloute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />itna pianpih neiloute, buaina bawlte, hekte, kidektheiloute, mi huhamte, hoih deih hetloute,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />zuautatte, kingaisang, thunung khualloute, Pathian itsang a amau kipahna kia itzawte a hi ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian limsak batna a nei ding ua, himahleh a thilhihtheihna a taksang kei ding uhi; tuabangte nungngatsan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Huchibangte lak a mite inn peuh a lut a gitlouh gikpua numei haideuhte sal a manman te ahi uhi, huchibang numeite duhgawlna chichih a pimang in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />zilzil napi a, thutak theipha ngeiloute ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Janni leh Jambri in Mosi a dou bang un, huai mite’n leng thutak a dou gige uhi; lungsim sesa ginna lam a Pathian deihlouh mi ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Himahleh huai val a hih kei ding uhi, a haidan uh Janni leh Jambri haidan a hong kitheih mah bang in miteng teng kiang a hong kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Himahleh nang zaw ka thugin, ka omdan, ka thiltup, ka ginna, ka thuakzohna, ka itna, ka kuhkalna na thei vek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hon sawina uh, hon gimbawlna uh na thei mahmah hi; Antiok khua, Ikoniam khua, Listra khua a ka tung a thiltung leh sawina ka thuakte; huai tengteng ah Toupa’n hon honkheta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, kuapeuh Khrist Jesu Pathian limsaka om tum photphot in sawina a thuak sam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Migilou leh mi khemhatte mi khem leh khem a om in a gilou semsem ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Himahleh nang zaw na zilsa leh kiptak a na gintaksa thutak ah om gige in, kua a kipan na zil hiam chih theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Huan Khrist Jesu ginna ziak a Hotdamna mu ding a nang hon hilhpilthei Laisiangthoute naupang nou a kipan theikhin na hi chih theigige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Laisiangthou peuhmah Pathian hatkhum a piak ahi a; huaiziak in thuhilhna ding, taihilhna ding, bawlhoihna ding, diktatna lam a kichilna ding in a phatuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huchi a Pathian mi na hoih chiteng semding a kimtak a kivan a a kim theihna ding in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian muh leh mihing leh misite ngaihtuah dingpa Khrist Jesu muh in, a kilakna leh a lalgam lou in, phatuamngaitak in k’on theisak hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu gen in; a hun hi in a hunlou ah leng pangzel in; thuakzoutak a thuhilh kawm in a siamlouhdan uh theisak inla, taihilh inla, hanthawn in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thuhilhna dik a ngaihkhiak ngaplouh hun uh hongtung ding hi; a bilte uh a zau ziak in amau deihlam bang in heutute a kiang uah a khawm ding uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A bilte uh thutak lam ah a ngongsak ding ua, tangthu lam naih in a pialta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang zaw bangkim ah pilvang in, gimthuak inla, Tanchinhoih genna lam nna sem in na nasepna pen hih tangtung in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei zaw tuin leng luikhiak in ka om lellel a, ka pawt hun a tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Douna hoih ka dou khinta a, ki taitehna ka tai khinta, ginna ka lenkip paisuakta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tun ah zaw diktatna lallukhu kei ading in koih in a omta, Toupa vaihawmpa diktat in huai ni chiang in kei a honpe ding, kei kiang kia hilou in a kilakna it peuhmahte kiang ah a pesam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kintak in ka kiang ah hongpai teitei in; Dema in tulai khovel a it ziak in hon paisan a ,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thessalonika khua ah a paita hi; Kristen Galatia gam ah a paita hi, Titas Dalmatia gam ah a paita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luke kia ka kiang ah a om hi. Mark chial inla, honpi in, amah nasepna lam ah kei ading in a phatuam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Taikika zaw Ephesa khua ah ka sawlta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na hongpai chiang in Troas khua a Karpa kiang a puanaktual ka nutsiat, laibute toh hontawi in, savun lai mahmah hontawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Alexander, dalsun siampa, ka tung ah a gilou mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Toupa’n a thilhih bangzel in a thuk ding; amah lak ah nang leng pilvang in, i thu a dou mahmah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka siamnathu ka gen masakpen in kuama’n a hon panpih kei ua, a hon zuausan vek uhi; a mawh pua in om tuankei uhen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tanchinhoih keimah ziak a hilhkim a a om theihna ding leh, Jentelte’n a zak theihna ding un, Toupa’n hon gum a a honhih hatzawta hi; Humpinelkai kam a kipan in suahtaksak in ka omta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Toupa’n gitlouhna tengteng lak a kipan in a hon suaktasak dia, a van gam a bittak in a hontun ding; Amah kiang ah tangtawn a thupina om hen. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Priscilla leh Akuila, Onesifora inkuanpihte toh, chibai hon buksak in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Erasta Korinth khua ah a om gige a, Trophimas bel Melita khua ah damlou in ka nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Phalbi ma in hongpai teitei in, Iubalate, Pudente, Lina te, Khlodia te leh unau tengteng in chibai a honbuk uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Toupa Jesu Khrist na kha kiang ah om hen. Hehpihna na kiang ah om hen. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
